            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What lies beyond the world we know? Is there another reality waiting to be discovered?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Alter World</strong>, a mysterious parallel reality where the rules are different and every step brings new challenges. Inspired by Stephen King's <i>The Dark Tower</i>, <strong>Alter World</strong> is a 2D platformer built around a unique mechanic that allows you to switch between two realities at any time to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and progress through the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level requires quick thinking and careful timing as you learn when to shift between worlds. Combined with its hand-painted visual style and atmospheric soundtrack, the journey offers a distinctive experience from beginning to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique reality-switching gameplay mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-focused platforming with fast-paced challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep moving through the Alter World, search for your friend, and be prepared for the unexpected.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What lies beyond the world we know? Is there another reality waiting to be discovered?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Alter World</strong>, a mysterious parallel reality where the rules are different and every step brings new challenges. Inspired by Stephen King's <i>The Dark Tower</i>, <strong>Alter World</strong> is a 2D platformer built around a unique mechanic that allows you to switch between two realities at any time to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and progress through the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level requires quick thinking and careful timing as you learn when to shift between worlds. Combined with its hand-painted visual style and atmospheric soundtrack, the journey offers a distinctive experience from beginning to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique reality-switching gameplay mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 handcrafted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different worlds to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-focused platforming with fast-paced challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep moving through the Alter World, search for your friend, and be prepared for the unexpected.</strong></p>",
